# =============================================================================
# TRACE-Kin v7 (SGED: Structure-Guided Embedding Distillation) smoke test
# =============================================================================
# Submit with:
#     bsub < training/run_v7_smoke_test.lsf
#
# Purpose: validate the v7 SGED architecture end-to-end on one cell before
# committing the 10-cell x 3-seed array. Checks:
#   - Structure Stream: GATv2 on contact-map -> pocket identification
#   - Embedding Stream: Multi-Scale PCER (K=16,64,all) with Mutation-Aware Gate
#   - Detached pocket_score coupling structure -> embedding streams
#   - Scale gating network + final regression head
#
# Runs train_trace_kin.py with a tiny sample (100 rows, 5 epochs) on
# the EITLEM kkm cold_drug MUTAPLM cell.
#
# After success, chain the per-folder arrays:
#     bsub -w "done(<SMOKE_JOB_ID>)" < training/run_v7_perfolder_s1.lsf
#     bsub < training/run_v7_perfolder_s2.lsf
#     bsub < training/run_v7_perfolder_s3.lsf
# =============================================================================

